# sim-benchmark-oss case allowlist.
#
# One <solver>/<physics-class>/<case-id> per line. Lines starting with #
# are comments. Blank lines ignored.
#
# Anything NOT listed here stays in private only. publish_oss.py will warn
# (not auto-delete) about cases present in the oss tree but not on this list.
#
# To add a new public case: append the path here, then re-run
#   python tools/publish_oss.py
# from the private repo root.
#
# Hard rules (not enforced by code, just convention):
#  - Only open-source-solver cases (OpenFOAM, LTspice, SU2, CalculiX, Elmer).
#  - Commercial-solver cases (COMSOL, Fluent, CFX, Abaqus, ...) NEVER go here.
#  - Cases under cases/_pending/ or cases/_template/ are drafts and never go here.

# --- LTspice circuits ---
ltspice/circuits/bridge_rectifier_ripple
ltspice/circuits/diff_amp
ltspice/circuits/half_wave_rectifier
ltspice/circuits/inv_amp
ltspice/circuits/lc_lowpass_2nd
ltspice/circuits/lc_resonator
ltspice/circuits/noninv_amp
ltspice/circuits/opamp_buffer
ltspice/circuits/opamp_integrator
ltspice/circuits/opamp_summer
ltspice/circuits/rc_highpass_ac
ltspice/circuits/rc_lowpass_ac
ltspice/circuits/rc_pulse_response
ltspice/circuits/rl_lowpass_ac
ltspice/circuits/rl_step
ltspice/circuits/rlc_bandpass
ltspice/circuits/rlc_notch
ltspice/circuits/rlc_step_overdamped
ltspice/circuits/rlc_step_underdamped
ltspice/circuits/sallen_key_lp

